les/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQMVBQM2hpenZOUUx1Y2pTa0hIVWQxZzVaTThJeGpuaW9ZLXhTSXEwbzhPS1RhWFlEclg5OFpyQ3p0YmhkU2o5Q0hOVmIxc1lsMEVDdmpQWHAzRzcybU1PSndacHRtLV9BTE9fM3FLZ2VXNkJsdlJ0cVRuWFVvZ0N1Tk1aa2VWTFk?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":""},{"title":"ON- A Semi Stock to Target After Synaptics Acquisition","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPOTZoU1RDX2Rta2gwZC1BSXVKeFRTMS01anAtMnNMd1ZQa2V3RE1jelJmQ0tUMkZJSzNWNHp5bmRGeWx1VFNMbmVKTkFKSDRiQVdyTXhhd2ZSM0VVd0ZyV21QckxvUGpxRkFpUDRON2psRndPZEtBLUppd1VRUmQ3Wkl0bVpNWlJuX2x0VExuLU9NdE1LdkxXZmpyaVNIT3g4ODY3RE1iVQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":6},{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-09","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1097864/000109786426000006/on-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"ON Semiconductor Corporation, together with its wholly and majority-owned subsidiaries, which operate under the onsemiTM brand (\"onsemi,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" or the \"Company\"), was incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware in 1992.","zh":"安森美半導體公司及其全資和控股子公司於 1992 年根據特拉華州法律成立，以 onsemiTM 品牌運營（“onsemi”、“我們”、“我們”、“我們的”或“公司”）。"},{"en":"We offer intelligent power and intelligent sensing solutions that drive electrification, energy efficiency, safety, and automation in automotive, industrial, and other end-markets, including AI data center. Our intelligent power technologies enable the electrification of drivetrain in the automotive industry to allow for lighter and longer-range electric vehicles and empower efficient fast-charging systems. Our intelligent sensing technologies enable advanced safety applications in automotive through industry leading performance and reliability.","zh":"我們提供智慧電源和智慧感測解決方案，推動汽車、工業和其他終端市場（包括人工智慧資料中心）的電氣化、能源效率、安全性和自動化。我們的智慧電源技術實現了汽車產業動力傳動系統的電氣化，從而實現更輕、續航里程更長的電動車，並支援高效的快速充電系統。我們的智慧感測技術透過業界領先的性能和可靠性實現汽車領域的先進安全應用。"},{"en":"We believe the evolution of the automotive industry, with advancements in autonomous driving, ADAS, vehicle electrification, and the increase in electronics content for vehicle platforms is reshaping the boundaries of transportation. Through sensing integration, we believe our intelligent power solutions achieve increased efficiencies compared to our peers. This integration allows lower temperature operation and reduced cooling requirements while saving costs and minimizing weight. In addition, our power solutions deliver power with less die per module, achieving higher range for a given battery capacity.","zh":"我們相信，隨著自動駕駛、ADAS、車輛電氣化的進步以及車輛平台電子內容的增加，汽車產業的發展正在重塑交通的邊界。透過感測集成，我們相信與同行相比，我們的智慧電源解決方案可以提高效率。這種整合允許更低的溫度運行並減少冷卻要求，同時節省成本並最大限度地減輕重量。此外，我們的電源解決方案以更少的每個模組晶片提供電力，從而在給定的電池容量下實現更高的續航里程。"}],"markets":[{"en":"PSG provides a broad portfolio of discrete, module, and integrated semiconductor devices designed to enable high efficiency and high power conversion across AI data centers, energy infrastructure, automotive and industrial. Our offerings include power switching devices, signal conditioning products, and circuit protection technologies that support increasing demands for performance, power density and system reliability.","zh":"PSG 提供廣泛的分離式、模組和整合式半導體裝置產品組合，旨在實現人工智慧資料中心、能源基礎設施、汽車和工業領域的高效率和高功率轉換。我們的產品包括電源開關元件、訊號調理產品和電路保護技術，可滿足對效能、功率密度和系統可靠性日益增長的需求。"},{"en":"Market demand for PSG products continues to be driven by vehicle electrification, renewable energy expansion, modernization of global power infrastructure, and the rapid scaling of AI and high performance computing systems. PSG's Silicon & WBG power technologies, spanning FETs and diodes, play a critical role in high power conversion for energy infrastructure, energy storage, AI data centers, fast-charging systems, electric vehicles and industrial drives. Our vertically integrated SiC manufacturing strategy enhances supply assurance, cost competitiveness, and device performance. PSG continues to advance its manufacturing footprint through network optimization initiatives that improve overall utilization and flexibility. These actions support long term gross margin expansion and enable efficient scaling of differentiated high value power products.","zh":"汽車電氣化、再生能源擴張、全球電力基礎設施現代化以及人工智慧和高效能運算系統的快速擴展繼續推動 PSG 產品的市場需求。 PSG 的矽和寬頻隙功率技術涵蓋 FET 和二極管，在能源基礎設施、能源儲存、人工智慧資料中心、快速充電系統、電動車和工業驅動的高功率轉換中發揮關鍵作用。我們的垂直整​​合 SiC 製造策略可增強供應保證、成本競爭力和裝置效能。 PSG 透過提高整體利用率和靈活性的網路優化舉措，持續推進其製造足跡。這些措施支持長期毛利率擴張，並實現差異化高價值電力產品的高效擴展。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We sell our products to direct customers and distributors for ultimate use in a variety of end-products in different end-markets. In general, we have maintained long-term relationships with our key customers, and our sales agreements are renewable periodically and contain certain terms and conditions with respect to payment, delivery, warranty and supply.","zh":"我們將產品銷售給直接客戶和分銷商，最終用於不同終端市場的各種最終產品。一般而言，我們與主要客戶保持長期關係，我們的銷售協議會定期更新，並包含有關付款、交付、保固和供應的某些條款和條件。"},{"en":"We generally warrant that products sold to our customers will, at the time of shipment, be free from defects in workmanship and materials and conform to our approved specifications. Our standard warranty extends for a period of two years from the date of delivery, except in the case of image sensor products, which are warranted for one year from the date of delivery. Unless otherwise agreed in writing, customers may cancel orders 45-120 days prior to shipment, depending on the product, for standard products without penalty and, for custom products, prior to shipment, provided they pay onsemi's actual costs incurred as of the date we receive the cancellation notice. The loss of one of our large customers would have a material adverse effect on the operations of the respective segment and may have a material adverse effect on our consolidated results of operations.","zh":"我們通常保證出售給客戶的產品在出貨時不存在工藝和材料缺陷，並符合我們批准的規格。我們的標準保固期為自交貨之日起兩年，影像感測器產品除外，其保固期為自交貨之日起一年。除非另有書面約定，客戶可以在發貨前 45-120 天取消訂單，具體取決於產品，對於標準產品，無需支付罰款；對於定制產品，客戶可以在發貨前取消訂單，但前提是他們支付了 onsemi 自我們收到取消通知之日起發生的實際費用。我們的一位大客戶的損失將對相應部門的營運產生重大不利影響，並可能對我們的綜合經營業績產生重大不利影響。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We face significant competition from major international semiconductor companies, as well as smaller companies focused on specific market niches. Because some of our components include functionality that in some cases may be integrated into more complex ICs, we also face competition from manufacturers of ICs, ASICs and fully-customized ICs, as well as customers who develop their own IC products. See \"Risk Factors — Trends, Risks and Uncertainties Related to Our Business\" included elsewhere in this Form 10-K for additional information.","zh":"我們面臨來自主要國際半導體公司以及專注於特定市場利基的小型公司的激烈競爭。由於我們的一些組件包含的功能在某些情況下可能會整合到更複雜的 IC 中，因此我們也面臨來自 IC、ASIC 和完全客製化 IC 製造商以及開發自己的 IC 產品的客戶的競爭。請參閱本表 10-K 中其他部分的“風險因素 — 與我們業務相關的趨勢、風險和不確定性”，以了解更多資訊。"},{"en":"Some of our competitors have greater financial and other resources to pursue development, engineering, manufacturing, marketing and distribution of their products and may generally be better situated to withstand adverse economic or market conditions. The semiconductor industry has experienced, and may continue to experience, significant consolidation among companies and vertical integration among customers. The following discusses the effects of competition on our three operating segments:","zh":"我們的一些競爭對手擁有更多的財務和其他資源來進行其產品的開發、工程、製造、行銷和分銷，並且通常可以更好地承受不利的經濟或市場條件。半導體產業已經並且可能會繼續經歷公司之間的重大整合和客戶之間的垂直整合。以下討論競爭對我們三個營運部門的影響："}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Power Solutions Group","val":2805100000,"zh":"電源解決方案集團"},{"name":"Analog Mixed Signal Group","val":2261900000,"zh":"類比混合訊號組"},{"name":"Intelligent Sensing Group","val":928400000,"zh":"智慧感測組"}],"total":5995400000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"HK","val":1634800000,"zh":"香港"},{"name":"GB","val":1347000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"SG","val":1252400000,"zh":"新加坡"},{"name":"US","val":1230600000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Geographical Areas","val":530600000,"zh":"其他地理區域"}],"total":5995400000}},"peers":["NXPI","MCHP","LRCX","ADI","GFS"]}}